Z||000000||Robert G., Frank||12-07-2001||02:10 PM||||Having wiring problems..Does anybody know where I can purchase wiring diagram or pre-assembled harness (88-6 to 96 park avenue 3800 S/C)||||reg||1
Z||000001||FieroJoe||12-07-2001||02:29 PM||||Try the junkyards, you might have to pull it yourself, which shouldnt be hard.  When you do get the correct one, you can send it to west coast Fiero to have them modify it and professionally crimp all the ends to make it work for the Fiero.  I have not seen an example of this service or heard anything about it, but I just know that they offer it on their website under the 3800 engine swap.  You can find thier link in the vendors section at the bottom of each forum page.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Wannabe||12-07-2001||10:34 PM||||Maybe we can team up on this and save a few $$. My 3.8 SC is from a '96 Riv. After some looking around, I was pretty much convinced that ordering two new manuals from Helm is the only way to go. ||||reg||1
Z||000003||reddog||12-07-2001||11:21 PM||||Try Chris West at West Coast Fieros. If i am not mistaken they will make a wiring set-up for your 3800 conversion!!<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Picturenew_sig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000004||Sleeper||12-08-2001||01:14 AM||||yeah, email west coast fiero, they'll probably sent you the diagram you desire.<P><p>[This message has been edited by Sleeper (edited 12-08-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000005||fieroX||12-08-2001||03:17 AM||||West coast fiero charges $300 for the wiring job.  If you have any wiring/electrical experience you can do it yourself.  Just get diagrams for both vehicles, take both wire looms, find out which wire goes to what, and match them up.  You will need to use the junction block harness end from the fiero on the 3800 wire loom.  You can probably put it together in a few hours, if you can read a wiring diagram.  Good luck!<P>------------------<BR>    <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroX.com" TARGET=_blank>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fierox.com/logo2small.gif">  </A><BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroX.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroX.com</A><BR>coming soon L67 powered 87 coupe||||reg||1
